sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cli
  participant U as TriageUseCase
  participant A as Artifacts
  participant G as Gatherer
  participant D as Audit
  C->>U: run(paths, budgets)
  U->>A: get(gatherer, path)
  A->>G: parse(text)
  alt file unreadable
    G-->>A: InputError
    A-->>U: ok false, reason
    U-->>U: add to skipped
  else file readable
    G-->>A: plain data
    A-->>U: ok true, data
    U->>D: run(data, budgets)
    D-->>U: findings
  end
  U-->>C: ranked report
